        "original_id": "55a74c3f-229b-5767-a988-f6861896e020",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Last Place, Ode to Janice Melt\n- People: Simon Helberg, Jeremy Konner, Jason Ritter\n- Organizations: Army Navy, The Fever Zone, The Big Bang Theory\n\nFacts:\n- Simon Helberg was born on December 9, 1980.\n- Simon Helberg is an American actor, comedian, and musician.\n- In 2007, Simon Helberg began playing Howard Wolowitz in the sitcom The Big Bang Theory.\n- The Last Place is the second studio album by the American indie rock band Army Navy.\n- Army Navy released The Last Place on July 12, 2011, on the band's own label, The Fever Zone.\n- A music video for Ode to Janice Melt was released on September 15, 2011.\n- Jeremy Konner directed the Ode to Janice Melt music video.\n- Jason Ritter and Simon Helberg starred in the Ode to Janice Melt music video.\n- In 2013, Simon Helberg won a Critics' Choice Television Award for The Big Bang Theory.",
